<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>LiveLock | Smart Door System</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #f4f6f8; color: #222; }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0a0a, #1f1f1f);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }
    header h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    header p {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #ccc;
    }
    section {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    ul {
      line-height: 2;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .feature-box {
      background: #f0f2f5;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .price {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #007bff;
    }
    footer {
      background: #111;
      color: #999;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>LiveLock™</h1>
  <p>Smart Security. Smart Living.</p>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>Product Overview</h2>
    <p>
      LiveLock™ is a smart interior door system designed to combine advanced
      biometric security, intelligent automation, and user-focused convenience.
      It transforms traditional doors into interactive, secure, and responsive
      living technology.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Core Features</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-box">Voice-Activated Control</div>
      <div class="feature-box">Fingerprint Recognition</div>
      <div class="feature-box">Facial Recognition</div>
      <div class="feature-box">Smartphone App Control</div>
      <div class="feature-box">Emergency Auto-Unlock</div>
      <div class="feature-box">Bluetooth Coffee Trigger</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Materials & Quality</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Reinforced solid-core composite wood structure</li>
      <li>Recycled aluminum internal framing</li>
      <li>Tempered smart-glass touch panel</li>
      <li>Low-energy, long-life sensor technology</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Suggested Retail Price</h2>
    <p class="price">$2,499 CAD</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Benefits for Users</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Enhanced home security and privacy</li>
      <li>Hands-free accessibility for all abilities</li>
      <li>Customized alerts and automation</li>
      <li>Time-saving smart routines</li>
      <li>Improved emergency response and safety</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>© 2025 LiveLock Smart Systems | Concept Project Website</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
